title: "Effective Fourier certificates for the full e=4 Polydegree column"
type: software
version: 0.1.0-candidate
date-released: 2026-08-23
authors:
  - name: "Anonymous"
abstract: >-
  Anonymous unrefereed three-paper candidate bundle. The principal result is
  the full e=4 Polydegree containment for every d at least 2, supported by a
  written analytic proof, 14,985 FLINT/Arb finite certificates, and exact
  normal/optimized replay. Companion papers provide a scoped Lean
  formalization and a conditional boundary-norm transfer theorem.
